  "publishedAt": "2022-03-11T00:00:00Z",
  "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/constrained-beam-search",
  "sourceTitle": "Guiding Text Generation with Constrained Beam Search in 🤗 Transformers",
  "sourceBodyHash": "268b77308e600ae4433cc4684985fdb837f0a77bc214483db5debd472d6eee8d",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "zcode",
  "requestedModel": "",
  "model": "glm-5.3-flash",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-17T05:05:32.816210Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-17T05:05:32.817210Z",
  "totalBlocks": 69,
  "translatedBlocks": 69,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b605350bc0020952",
      "translationZh": "简介",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cefbe7e5b27d35f",
      "translationZh": "这篇博文假设读者已熟悉使用束搜索各种变体进行文本生成的方法，相关内容见博文《How to generate text: using different decoding methods for language generation with Transformers》。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "081e02329567817f",
      "translationZh": "与普通束搜索不同，受限束搜索（constrained beam search）让我们能够控制文本生成的输出。这很有用，因为有时我们确切地知道输出里要有什么。例如，在神经机器翻译任务中，我们可能通过查词典知道最终译文必须包含哪些词。有时，对语言模型而言可能性几乎相同的生成结果，在特定上下文下对最终用户的合意程度却大不相同。这两种情况都可以通过让用户告诉模型最终输出必须包含哪些词来解决。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "baa1812f7688c2ae",
      "translationZh": "为什么这很难",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e73eafe8704775ab",
      "translationZh": "然而，这实际上是个非常不平凡的问题。因为这个任务要求我们在生成过程中的某个时点，强制在最终输出的某处生成特定的子序列。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "427e732aef3cfcbd",
      "translationZh": "假设我们想生成一个句子 S，它必须按顺序包含短语 p1={t1, t2}，其中 token 为 t1、t2。定义期望的句子 S 为：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e41ade759404014",
      "translationZh": "S_expected = {s1, s2, ..., sk, t1, t2, s(k+1), ..., sn}",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19d3f5c4a5650937",
      "translationZh": "问题在于，束搜索是逐个 token 生成序列的。虽然不完全准确，可以把束搜索想成函数 B(s_(0:i)) = s_(i+1)：它查看当前已生成的从 0 到 i 的 token 序列，然后预测第 i+1 个 token。但这个函数怎么可能在任意步骤 i<k 时就知道这些 token 必须在未来的某步 k 生成？或者当它处于 i=k 时，它怎能确定这里就是强制生成这些 token 的最佳位置，而不是未来的某个 i>k？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4202065a2983cef",
      "translationZh": "如果你有多个要求各异的约束呢？如果想同时强制短语 p1={t1, t2} 和 p2={t3, t4, t5, t6} 呢？如果想让模型在两个短语之间二选一呢？如果想强制 p1、并在短语列表 {p21, p22, p23} 中强制恰好一个呢？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "537c55661395d73a",
      "translationZh": "如下文所示，上述例子都是非常合理的用例，而新的受限束搜索功能全部支持！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "243adb7b0c5309b5",
      "translationZh": "本文将快速介绍新的受限束搜索功能能为你做什么，然后深入讲解它的底层工作原理。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "409afed6e9e19af1",
      "translationZh": "示例 1：强制一个词",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9136f1989c0d0411",
      "translationZh": "假设我们想把 \"How old are you?\" 翻译成德语。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b57db8380e497ab2",
      "translationZh": "非正式场合说 \"Wie alt bist du?\"，正式场合说 \"Wie alt sind Sie?\"。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f991682548d9ac13",
      "translationZh": "根据上下文，我们可能想要其中一种正式程度的形式，但怎么告诉模型呢？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c39064375f6873e6",
      "translationZh": "传统束搜索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35910d5b6afd8693",
      "translationZh": "传统束搜索设定下，我们会这样做文本翻译。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "aaa6ceb505fbe37b",
      "translationZh": "使用受限束搜索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1142368a316da012",
      "translationZh": "但如果我们已经确定想要正式的而非随意的输出呢？如果我们凭先验知识知道生成结果必须包含什么，并且可以把它注入生成过程呢？",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b62353907d00fbc6",
      "translationZh": "下面展示了现在通过 model.generate() 的 force_words_ids 关键字参数可以做到的事：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a23c17299ea5fdad",
      "translationZh": "如你所见，我们成功用关于期望输出的先验知识引导了生成。以前我们只能先生成一堆可能的输出，再筛选出符合要求的；现在在生成阶段就能做到。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0d75353474474aa4",
      "translationZh": "示例 2：析取约束",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f779dc801bd9a648",
      "translationZh": "我们上面提到过一个用例：我们知道最终输出要包含哪些词。一个例子是神经机器翻译中的词典查询。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2820a847cc917f37",
      "translationZh": "但如果不知道该用哪种词形，希望 [\"raining\", \"rained\", \"rains\", ...] 这样的输出形式同等可能呢？更一般地说，总有些时候我们不想要逐字母的精确原词，而愿意接受其他相关的可能性。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "475919a07ff7d093",
      "translationZh": "允许这种行为的是析取约束（Disjunctive Constraints）：用户输入一个词列表，其作用是引导生成，使最终输出只需包含列表中至少一个词。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8bc730ab809735b8",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个混合使用上述两类约束的例子：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09868db563e1a552",
      "translationZh": "可以看到，第一个输出用了 \"screaming\"，第二个输出用了 \"screamed\"，而两者都原样使用了 \"scared\"。供选择的列表 [\"screaming\", \"screamed\", ...] 不必是词形变化；任何“从列表中只要一个”的用例都能满足。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4ac75203e659bfd7",
      "translationZh": "传统束搜索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a089a248fd0eb0d",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个传统束搜索的例子，取自之前的一篇博文：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0bc18af55a8e27f",
      "translationZh": "与贪婪搜索不同，束搜索的原理是保留更长的假设列表。上图中，我们在生成的每个可能步骤都展示了三个可能的下一 token。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "168f835730470a11",
      "translationZh": "对上面的例子，在 num_beams=3 的情形下，可以换一种方式看束搜索的第一步：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fee966d6bffb5811",
      "translationZh": "贪婪搜索只会选 \"The dog\"，而束搜索会允许进一步考虑 \"The nice\" 和 \"The car\"。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5682a36f5bc1a322",
      "translationZh": "下一步，我们为上一步产生的三个分支分别考虑下一个可能的 token。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab7cc3cd9dfc415d",
      "translationZh": "尽管我们最终考虑的输出远多于 num_beams 个，但每步结束时会把它们缩减回 num_beams 个。我们不能无限制地分支下去，否则 n 步之后要跟踪的束数量将是 beams^n——增长极快（10 个束走 10 步就是 100 亿个束！）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5884e2871a49b70",
      "translationZh": "在余下的生成过程中，我们重复上述步骤，直到满足结束条件，例如生成了 <eos> token 或达到 max_length。分支、排序、缩减、重复。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8e16ff8ec0b84f9c",
      "translationZh": "受限束搜索",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f48893d49591b1e",
      "translationZh": "受限束搜索通过在生成的每一步注入期望的 token 来尝试满足约束。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b62a87b96bdd2206",
      "translationZh": "假设我们想在生成的输出中强制出现短语 \"is fast\"。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19103ff2174a42fd",
      "translationZh": "在传统束搜索设定下，我们在每个分支找出概率最高的 k 个下一 token 并加入考虑。在受限设定下，我们同样如此，但还会加入那些让我们更接近满足约束的 token。演示如下：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df0de0026bd61412",
      "translationZh": "在 \"dog\"、\"nice\" 这些常见的高概率下一 token 之外，我们强制加入了 token \"is\"，让我们更接近满足 \"is fast\" 这一约束。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f0bc93db45b23c4",
      "translationZh": "下一步，展开的候选大多与传统束搜索相同。但如上例所示，受限束搜索会在每个新分支上通过强制约束来扩充现有候选：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0959e9bdd3051a41",
      "translationZh": "组（Bank）",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3dd3fb4be060e3e7",
      "translationZh": "在讲下一步之前，我们需要想想上一步中能看到的那种不理想行为。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c30319bdaf58af4",
      "translationZh": "天真地把期望短语 \"is fast\" 强塞进输出的问题在于：多数时候你会得到诸如 \"The is fast\" 这样的无意义输出。这正是这个问题不平凡的原因。关于解决此问题之复杂性的更深入讨论，可见 huggingface/transformers 中最初提出的 feature request issue。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e2a53ff9610b607",
      "translationZh": "组（Bank）通过在满足约束与生成通顺输出之间取得平衡来解决这个问题。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "277f433097878525",
      "translationZh": "组 n 指在满足约束方面已取得 n 步进展的束列表。把所有可能的束分入各自的组之后，我们做轮询选择。以上例而言：我们从组 2 选概率最高的输出，再从组 1 选概率最高的，再从组 0 选一个，然后是组 2 的次高、组 1 的次高，以此类推。由于 num_beams=3，只需把上述过程做三次，得到 [\"The is fast\", \"The dog is\", \"The dog and\"]。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca5f001398664275",
      "translationZh": "这样，即使我们强制模型考虑手动加入了期望 token 的分支，我们仍然保留着其他大概率、多半更通顺的序列。\"The is fast\" 虽然完全满足约束，却不是个通顺的短语。幸运的是，我们还有 \"The dog is\" 和 \"The dog and\" 可以在后续步骤中继续发展，希望它们稍后能导出更通顺的输出。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abbf581ea7e1bdf6",
      "translationZh": "上述例子的第三步演示了这种行为：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7c8b08bbcac15b6",
      "translationZh": "注意 \"The is fast\" 不再需要手动追加约束 token，因为它已满足约束（即已包含短语 \"is fast\"）。还要注意，像 \"The dog is slow\"、\"The dog is mad\" 这样的束其实处于组 0——虽然包含了 token \"is\"，但它必须从头重新生成 \"is fast\"；在 \"is\" 后面加了 \"slow\" 之类，等于把进度清零了。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fa362e409acbae3",
      "translationZh": "最后注意，我们最终得到了包含约束短语的通顺输出：\"The dog is fast\"！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11fe6533a055a794",
      "translationZh": "起初我们很担心，因为盲目追加期望 token 会产生 \"The is fast\" 这类无意义短语。然而，通过从各组做轮询选择，我们自然而然地淘汰了无意义输出，偏爱更通顺的输出。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "305a784bfc7efdc9",
      "translationZh": "更多关于 Constraint 类与自定义约束",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a65f1099b77e867d",
      "translationZh": "上述解释的核心结论可以概括为：在每一步，我们不断“催促”模型去考虑满足约束的 token，同时一直保留不满足约束的束，直到最终得到包含期望短语、概率也够高的序列。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78c64aea442ecbb4",
      "translationZh": "因此，这一实现的一种有原则的设计方式，是把每个约束表示为一个 Constraint 对象，其职责是跟踪自身进度并告诉束搜索下一步该生成哪些 token。虽然我们为 model.generate() 提供了 force_words_ids 关键字参数，后端实际发生的事情如下：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92cf4919cc830290",
      "translationZh": "你可以自己定义一个 Constraint，并通过 constraints 关键字参数传入，设计你独有的约束。只需创建 Constraint 抽象接口类的子类并遵循其要求即可。更多信息见此处的 Constraint 定义。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99ae8fca1fab04ff",
      "translationZh": "一些独特的想法（尚未实现；也许你可以试试！）包括 OrderedConstraints、TemplateConstraints 等未来可能加入的约束。目前的生成方式是在输出的任意位置包含这些序列。例如，前面的例子中一个序列是 scared -> screaming，另一个是 screamed -> scared。OrderedConstraints 可以让用户指定这些约束被满足的顺序。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "586be70be36f90f2",
      "translationZh": "TemplateConstraints 可以支持更小众的用法，其目标可以形如：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "533fd7aab37e48dc",
      "translationZh": "或者：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67dbe8a3838c3332",
      "translationZh": "如果用户不在乎两个词之间可以隔多少个 token，那么直接使用 OrderedConstraint 即可。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ee0f6e3a13d7bff",
      "translationZh": "受限束搜索给了我们一种灵活的手段，把外部知识与要求注入文本生成。以前，没有办法轻易告诉模型：1. 包含一组序列，2. 其中一些可选一些必选，3. 它们要在序列中各自合理的位置生成。现在，通过混合使用不同的 Constraint 子类，我们能完全掌控生成过程！",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0bcca015de26455",
      "translationZh": "这一新特性主要基于以下论文：",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc51c351a38e7635",
      "translationZh": "Guided Open Vocabulary Image Captioning with Constrained Beam Search",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b552a7bbbabfb871",
      "translationZh": "Fast Lexically Constrained Decoding with Dynamic Beam Allocation for Neural Machine Translation",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "52dca81afde2590b",
      "translationZh": "Improved Lexically Constrained Decoding for Translation and Monolingual Rewriting",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f887eab63dda6372",
      "translationZh": "Guided Generation of Cause and Effect",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74f30af4528b59a8",
      "translationZh": "与上述论文一样，许多新研究都在探索用外部知识（如知识图谱、知识库）引导大型深度学习模型输出的方法。希望这个受限束搜索特性成为达成该目的的又一有效途径。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1bdba56ac9303a89",
      "translationZh": "感谢所有为这个特性贡献提供指导的人：Patrick von Platen 从最初的 issue 到最终的 PR 都全程参与，Narsil Patry 对代码给出了细致反馈。",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb2a59e310c80706",
      "translationZh": "本文缩略图使用的图标署名：Shorthand icons created by Freepik - Flaticon",
      "provider": "zcode",
      "model": "glm-5.3-flash"
    }
  ],
